WEBVTT

00:00:01.480 --> 00:00:03.320
I prepared the stage.

00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:07.240
I prepared the comedy, Much Ado About Nothing.

00:00:08.570 --> 00:00:14.160
If we overpower a member of your council in my play field,

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:16.450
that person can be used as a card to stop Musashi.

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:23.170
It likewise gives us the right to draw your Chancellor into my play field and challenge him to a duel.

00:00:24.130 --> 00:00:25.550
The curtain has risen.

00:00:28.470 --> 00:00:29.300
Gentlemen.

00:02:05.480 --> 00:02:06.360
Prayer!

00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:09.190
Tomo, what is the matter?

00:02:18.580 --> 00:02:19.830
My king!

00:02:29.250 --> 00:02:31.010
So a foe has appeared.

00:02:31.010 --> 00:02:34.630
Suzu, may I come in?

00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:36.930
Ah, f-feel free.

00:02:44.190 --> 00:02:47.360
Suzu, could you come up by the mirror?

00:02:47.360 --> 00:02:54.990
Ummm...

00:02:55.450 --> 00:02:56.990
Look at this.

00:03:01.040 --> 00:03:03.450
Why don't you get changed?

00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:07.580
The target is going to change clothes!

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:09.960
This will be our last live report!

00:03:15.970 --> 00:03:18.550
I'm going to take this off for you, okay?

00:03:21.810 --> 00:03:23.060
She's undressing! She's undressing!

00:03:24.890 --> 00:03:27.520
But I'm hearing the sound of clanking armour even though she's undressing.

00:03:27.520 --> 00:03:29.230
Contact!

00:03:29.650 --> 00:03:31.150
Charge!

00:03:34.360 --> 00:03:35.900
You weren't changing at all!

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:38.610
You betrayed our innocent hearts!

00:03:42.330 --> 00:03:43.660
I'm surprised.

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:46.080
It's spacious in here, isn't it?

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:48.370
It can be used to hole up in case of emergencies.

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:53.340
At any rate, let's wait it out until help comes.

00:03:53.340 --> 00:03:57.510
I've got snacks, drinks, music and rhythm games.

00:03:57.510 --> 00:04:02.010
But will Futayo be okay?

00:04:02.010 --> 00:04:06.430
Well, she's dangerous in more ways than one.

00:04:07.230 --> 00:04:11.230
I am Vice Chancellor Honda Futayo,

00:04:11.230 --> 00:04:12.360
allied with Musashi Ariadust Academy.

00:04:15.030 --> 00:04:17.150
You're allied with Oxford Academy...

00:04:17.150 --> 00:04:20.820
Trump 1, Sir Walter Raleigh, I see...

00:04:20.820 --> 00:04:23.870
I've heard that the majority of the Far Easterners

00:04:23.870 --> 00:04:26.160
residing in England are remnants of the Amago clan.

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:29.710
Are you one of the Ten Brave Amago Warriors' survivors?

00:04:31.130 --> 00:04:33.710
Judge. You are not a man of many words.

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:35.710
In that case...

00:04:46.930 --> 00:04:49.190
The five caught by the enemy are:

00:04:49.190 --> 00:04:50.690
Mito and Masazumi,

00:04:50.690 --> 00:04:52.190
Naito and Naruze,

00:04:52.190 --> 00:04:53.900
and Ulquiaga.

00:04:53.900 --> 00:04:57.940
Tori and Horizon, Heidi and Shirojiro,

00:04:57.940 --> 00:04:59.610
Suzu and Adele,

00:04:59.610 --> 00:05:01.660
and Futayo are outside the barrier.

00:05:01.660 --> 00:05:05.200
My transmissions to Suzu and Adele are blocked though.

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:10.120
Is England into securing the foreign ambassador before picking a fight?

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:12.880
Tori and Horizon are in even more danger.

00:05:12.880 --> 00:05:15.210
They'll undoubtedly get targeted as contenders in a duel.

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:19.380
For one as grand as I, rescuing them would be a cinch.

00:05:19.380 --> 00:05:22.840
But wouldn't it put my foolish brother out if I blew off the rules of dueling?

00:05:22.840 --> 00:05:24.550
What do you think I should do?

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:27.390
Everyone understands what exactly their date means.

00:05:27.390 --> 00:05:30.560
They'll fight to keep the right of challenge from falling into enemy hands.

00:05:30.890 --> 00:05:34.060
So let's give everyone our full support.

00:05:42.610 --> 00:05:44.620
Why is everyone looking at me?

00:05:48.540 --> 00:05:51.540
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:05:51.870 --> 00:05:53.290
Living Bones?

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:55.080
Have a nice death!

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:56.590
I'm the deathly Lord Chancellor,

00:05:56.590 --> 00:06:01.050
Trump No. 3, Christopher Hatton!

00:06:05.140 --> 00:06:09.520
What grade did you get on your second year third trimester final in PE?

00:06:09.520 --> 00:06:12.390
Huh? 87...

00:06:15.150 --> 00:06:17.230
Such a high score!

00:06:17.230 --> 00:06:18.940
In that case, for the crime of acting erotic,

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:20.150
you're sentenced to...

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:21.570
...death!

00:06:21.570 --> 00:06:23.950
You just wanted to say "death"!

00:06:26.240 --> 00:06:28.620
Die!

00:06:28.620 --> 00:06:29.870
Blow up and die.

00:06:29.870 --> 00:06:31.370
Pass on after death.

00:06:33.290 --> 00:06:34.370
But you'll get caught in the blas—

00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:37.130
Y-You can swap bodies?!

00:06:37.130 --> 00:06:38.790
Have a nice death!

00:06:44.130 --> 00:06:46.090
Dance Revolution!

00:06:48.850 --> 00:06:49.890
What is this?

00:06:49.890 --> 00:06:54.230
Hey, Ulqui! Look at me!

00:06:54.230 --> 00:06:56.900
This must be a form of brainwashing.

00:06:56.900 --> 00:06:59.020
I'm up against a monster?

00:06:59.020 --> 00:07:00.780
Eek, that's so scary!

00:07:00.780 --> 00:07:01.980
The seal?!

00:07:01.980 --> 00:07:03.990
I'm Trump No. 8!

00:07:03.990 --> 00:07:07.240
Here I, Nicholas Bacon, go!

00:07:09.160 --> 00:07:12.950
I'm thinking that this must be a play field and...

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:16.830
I hope Malga will be okay.

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:18.880
She tries to act so tough...

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:21.710
Verwandlung!

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:23.760
Schwarze Frauen!

00:07:46.200 --> 00:07:48.110
A virtual ocean for swimming?

00:07:48.110 --> 00:07:49.450
You could tell?

00:07:49.450 --> 00:07:52.450
This is the instant large-sized pool used by

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:54.620
the Oxford Mariner Club for practice.

00:07:54.620 --> 00:07:56.790
I am Captain of the Mariner Club's Swim Team,

00:07:56.790 --> 00:07:59.670
Trump No. 5-2, Hawkins!

00:07:59.670 --> 00:08:00.920
I am the Mariner Club's manager,

00:08:00.920 --> 00:08:03.130
Trump 5-3, Cavendish.

00:08:03.130 --> 00:08:03.960
Have at me!

00:08:03.960 --> 00:08:05.840
Today our bout will be in the pool!

00:08:07.050 --> 00:08:07.800
Take this!

00:08:08.050 --> 00:08:09.140
Malga...

00:08:12.010 --> 00:08:15.220
I am Trump 5-1 of the Mariner Club, Drake.

00:08:15.220 --> 00:08:18.270
I'm the 4th Special Agent, Malga Naruze.

00:08:18.270 --> 00:08:21.940
What precisely does England's hero of the sea need with me?

00:08:21.940 --> 00:08:23.520
I want to talk to you.

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:24.570
I'll buy you a drink.

00:08:25.860 --> 00:08:26.990
Coffee.

00:08:26.990 --> 00:08:28.450
Milk for me.

00:08:28.450 --> 00:08:30.910
Make it unprocessed.

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:35.660
Milk is a transformed state of blood.

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:38.750
The various blood-consuming beings in England love it.

00:08:38.750 --> 00:08:42.750
They say that wolf-type races have a tendency to eat humans.

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:44.170
Do you intend to eat me?

00:08:44.960 --> 00:08:46.460
If you give your consent.

00:08:47.170 --> 00:08:49.340
See, I'm a gentleman since I'm a knight.

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:51.050
I made sure to get permission from even my wife first.

00:08:51.050 --> 00:08:53.470
You ate your wife?

00:08:53.470 --> 00:08:58.140
There are some humans who feel that getting hurt makes it permissible for them to reside with the living.

00:08:58.140 --> 00:09:01.940
Besides, I can't afford to dither when it comes to my wife.

00:09:01.940 --> 00:09:03.020
I see.

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:05.360
Your wife is a serial killer, isn't she?

00:09:05.360 --> 00:09:08.900
Yeah. If I don't tear her apart, she'll tear me apart instead.

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:10.740
How did you propose?

00:09:10.740 --> 00:09:12.240
It was rather normal.

00:09:12.240 --> 00:09:13.950
While we were eating meat,

00:09:13.950 --> 00:09:15.990
I said, "I love you! You're the best!"

00:09:15.990 --> 00:09:17.660
"Then help yourself," she said.

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:19.620
You're a perfect match.

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:23.710
Say, don't the knights where you're from share similar practices as well?

00:09:23.710 --> 00:09:24.590
Why would they?

00:09:24.590 --> 00:09:26.590
You know of Joan of Arc,

00:09:26.590 --> 00:09:31.010
who freed Hexagone Francaise during the Hundred Years War, yes?

00:09:31.010 --> 00:09:35.050
There are concerns that she avoided getting burned at the stake.

00:09:36.180 --> 00:09:39.060
And how would that be related to Mitotsudaira?

00:09:39.680 --> 00:09:44.060
The family of knights Nate Mitotsudaira hails from was of a small domain,

00:09:44.060 --> 00:09:47.820
but they jumped to the foreground once they married in a female werewolf.

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:54.070
I suspect they had something to do with the werewolf unit that rescued Joan of Arc.

00:09:54.070 --> 00:09:56.620
So you want me to ask Mitotsudaira about it, right?

00:09:56.620 --> 00:09:59.620
Alas, she fell out of my jurisdiction...

00:09:59.620 --> 00:10:03.210
Meaning someone else went to face Mitotsudaira, huh?

00:10:03.210 --> 00:10:04.750
As for you...

00:10:04.750 --> 00:10:08.750
Dang, I live for this mug of goodness!

00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:11.380
It's showtime once you finish up, isn't it?

00:10:11.380 --> 00:10:13.470
Yes, indeed it is.

00:10:14.140 --> 00:10:15.470
England's Testament Armament!

00:10:15.470 --> 00:10:18.010
Dudley's is for the left hand.

00:10:18.010 --> 00:10:19.430
Mine is for the right.

00:10:19.430 --> 00:10:21.560
It's the Brachium Justitia Vetus.

00:10:21.560 --> 00:10:22.430
It has the power

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:27.570
to always thwart whoever tries to sully England's justice.

00:10:29.150 --> 00:10:31.070
Justice can be a real pain.

00:10:31.650 --> 00:10:34.450
It devours any who defy it.

00:10:34.450 --> 00:10:37.240
So I must stab at your justice in a way that won't get me eaten.

00:10:37.620 --> 00:10:39.620
That's a Technohexen's job!

00:10:42.580 --> 00:10:44.330
Going by their trail,

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:46.500
the two of them came here on their date.

00:10:48.460 --> 00:10:52.920
The enemy closest to my king, the foe I must face, is...

00:10:54.930 --> 00:10:55.800
...over there!

00:10:57.720 --> 00:11:00.470
Trump 2, F. Walsingham!

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:05.100
A model with full gravitational control?!

00:11:07.770 --> 00:11:09.730
Mode: Counter Attack.

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:19.410
Shift: Burst Mode.

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:25.540
Enclose around her!

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:33.010
Wars of the Roses.

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:36.720
Bite a Keeping Wolf!

00:11:40.050 --> 00:11:42.600
Would ya like somethin' to eat, Horizon?

00:11:43.100 --> 00:11:46.270
Master Tori, according to my automated doll senses,

00:11:46.270 --> 00:11:50.190
a large part of London has been transformed into some sort of barrier.

00:11:50.190 --> 00:11:52.650
I determine it is dangerous for you to stay here, Master Tori.

00:11:52.650 --> 00:11:54.570
There's nothing dangerous here!

00:11:54.570 --> 00:11:57.200
If there were, those guys would've informed us.

00:11:57.200 --> 00:12:00.660
Since they haven't, they've taken it on themselves to deal with the problem,

00:12:00.660 --> 00:12:03.370
which means we oughta do what we oughta do.

00:12:03.370 --> 00:12:07.370
But what you and I must do is to...

00:12:07.670 --> 00:12:09.170
Go on a date, right?

00:12:09.170 --> 00:12:12.420
We must discuss whether or not I am interested in emotions

00:12:12.420 --> 00:12:15.760
and then use that as a reference to determine your own course of actions

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:18.510
for the fate of Musashi.

00:12:18.510 --> 00:12:20.510
Eh?! And our date?

00:12:21.930 --> 00:12:26.730
Then I request that you get serious with me and take me on a date.

00:12:27.430 --> 00:12:30.400
I lack an interest in emotions.

00:12:30.400 --> 00:12:33.230
Please give me reason enough to reverse that stance.

00:12:33.610 --> 00:12:37.650
And then please decide if you truly intend to use Musashi and my Armament of Deadly Sins

00:12:37.650 --> 00:12:41.030
to begin world conquest in earnest.

00:12:41.570 --> 00:12:44.790
It sounds like this is going to be one heck of a date!

00:12:44.790 --> 00:12:46.750
Can I handle it?

00:12:46.750 --> 00:12:48.410
Come now, Master Tori.

00:12:49.920 --> 00:12:50.580
Yeah!

00:13:01.090 --> 00:13:02.930
The stall over there is selling them.

00:13:02.930 --> 00:13:05.390
No, I shall go buy them myself.

00:13:05.390 --> 00:13:07.350
Master Tenzo, can you speak English?

00:13:08.980 --> 00:13:11.480
I don't really need to eat anything...

00:13:11.480 --> 00:13:14.940
That defeats the point of coming to the festival.

00:13:16.230 --> 00:13:19.860
Crap! I'm acting just like the type of guy girls hate!

00:13:20.900 --> 00:13:25.910
But it seems rather dead for a festival...

00:13:26.240 --> 00:13:28.870
Here you go. This is enough for two.

00:13:30.080 --> 00:13:32.880
I wonder if they are showing a play or something.

00:13:32.880 --> 00:13:34.710
I'm a little curious.

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:39.210
But first let us visit the place we must go see.

00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:49.520
Make sure not to skim through.

00:13:49.520 --> 00:13:55.190
I have included deals that are <i>extremely</i> advantageous to us, so humour me.

00:13:55.190 --> 00:13:56.230
Since I cannot fight,

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:59.070
this is how I buy the others time.

00:14:03.950 --> 00:14:06.330
Why'd you dodge?

00:14:08.040 --> 00:14:10.830
That dangerous weapon is your great seal, is it not?

00:14:10.830 --> 00:14:14.250
Yes. I'm the Lord Keeper of the Great Seal!

00:14:14.250 --> 00:14:17.880
In other words, its blows contain the power of England itself.

00:14:17.880 --> 00:14:20.300
Let me ask. Do you have an older sister?

00:14:20.960 --> 00:14:22.550
I sure don't!

00:14:22.550 --> 00:14:23.760
What a totally rude thing to ask during battle!

00:14:23.760 --> 00:14:24.760
I see...

00:14:25.260 --> 00:14:28.510
Nicholas Bacon, you have committed two sins!

00:14:28.810 --> 00:14:29.810
I'm a heretic?

00:14:29.810 --> 00:14:33.480
Nay! First, you lack a big sister!

00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:35.650
On top of that,

00:14:35.650 --> 00:14:38.190
you're not the younger brother of a big sister!

00:14:40.780 --> 00:14:42.860
Soaring bounds!

00:14:46.120 --> 00:14:46.700
Wha—

00:14:49.330 --> 00:14:52.040
Crotch-tearing Torture Spell #17,

00:14:54.210 --> 00:14:55.710
Electric Massage!

00:14:57.170 --> 00:14:58.920
What's this? It's as if nothing is there...

00:14:58.920 --> 00:15:01.420
You're horrible! I'm a fairy!

00:15:04.220 --> 00:15:07.090
Nicholas Bacon, you're...

00:15:07.550 --> 00:15:09.140
You finally figured it out?

00:15:09.140 --> 00:15:10.810
Took long enough!

00:15:10.810 --> 00:15:13.520
I'm the Seal of the Queen's guardian fairy.

00:15:13.850 --> 00:15:16.400
Ulqui! Ulqui, Ulqui!

00:15:16.400 --> 00:15:17.980
Good luck!

00:15:17.980 --> 00:15:20.110
Ulqui, look over here!

00:15:21.150 --> 00:15:22.320
Preparing for Spell of Creation "January".
You rock!

00:15:22.320 --> 00:15:24.360
Ulqui, look at me!

00:15:24.360 --> 00:15:25.070
Ulqui! Ya-hoo!

00:15:25.070 --> 00:15:27.990
I'll punch Ohiroshiki three times to bring him back to his senses!
Ulqui! Ya-hoo!

00:15:33.120 --> 00:15:34.290
What?!

00:15:34.290 --> 00:15:36.170
What are you doing, Ulqui?!

00:15:36.170 --> 00:15:38.630
How dare you fight my religious ideals!

00:15:38.630 --> 00:15:43.050
It would seem my companions have broken free of the play field's spell.

00:15:43.050 --> 00:15:43.800
Lame.

00:15:43.800 --> 00:15:47.590
I wish the spell was made so that it wouldn't break if a single onlooker snapped out of it.

00:15:49.760 --> 00:15:51.470
Well, let's call it a wrap!

00:15:51.470 --> 00:15:54.310
Look forward to facing me again on another stage.

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:04.440
Obelisks! Drop the course for numbers 1-4!

00:16:04.440 --> 00:16:04.740
Tes!

00:16:15.750 --> 00:16:17.000
A substitution move?!

00:16:20.460 --> 00:16:23.920
<i>She shouldn't be able to chant magic spells in the water...</i>

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:29.090
<i>She took advantage of my jet?!</i>

00:16:29.090 --> 00:16:30.340
Herrlich!

00:16:32.550 --> 00:16:33.930
Cavendish!

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:34.310
Tes!

00:16:37.850 --> 00:16:39.190
<i>Secure firing position!</i>

00:16:41.230 --> 00:16:42.730
Obelisks?!

00:16:58.000 --> 00:16:59.040
Impossible!

00:16:59.040 --> 00:17:00.870
Herrlich!

00:17:02.210 --> 00:17:04.090
Kickboard Shield!

00:17:07.590 --> 00:17:09.170
This is the end!

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:10.510
Hawkins!

00:17:13.680 --> 00:17:17.180
This fulfillment is what sports are about!

00:17:32.240 --> 00:17:33.240
Malga!

00:17:38.080 --> 00:17:40.750
What do you think of my war cry?

00:17:40.750 --> 00:17:43.000
It makes for a most impressive howl.

00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:46.210
<i>You need silver weapons to injure a Hard Wolf.</i>

00:17:55.470 --> 00:17:56.430
That's...!

00:17:56.430 --> 00:17:58.020
That's not all it can do.

00:18:00.770 --> 00:18:04.020
So it rejects anything that could harm justice at some point in time.

00:18:04.020 --> 00:18:06.520
Even acupuncture doesn't work on me.

00:18:06.520 --> 00:18:07.730
Oh, and by the way...

00:18:07.730 --> 00:18:10.150
Try repeating the same attack.

00:18:13.660 --> 00:18:16.160
It optimises moves.

00:18:16.160 --> 00:18:20.540
England's justice memorizes the intentions of whoever means it harm,

00:18:20.540 --> 00:18:24.370
predicts the corrupt course of action and bungles it up.

00:18:24.370 --> 00:18:25.790
In other words,

00:18:25.790 --> 00:18:32.130
it'll eventually memorize what each of your actions means, down to your breathing.

00:18:49.690 --> 00:18:50.940
Those are dangerous.

00:19:02.250 --> 00:19:04.500
Body... Strengthening...

00:19:04.500 --> 00:19:07.330
Fortification magic doesn't tarnish your justice,

00:19:07.330 --> 00:19:08.750
so it won't get rejected.

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:11.960
But if you compound the strain those war cries have on your body

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:14.720
with dozens of layers of fortification magic,

00:19:15.180 --> 00:19:19.510
even a Hard Wolf's body will get pushed beyond its limits.

00:19:20.010 --> 00:19:20.810
This fight—

00:19:23.270 --> 00:19:25.890
It's been ages since I felt so awake!

00:19:25.890 --> 00:19:26.980
You're bloody good!

00:19:26.980 --> 00:19:30.440
I must replenish the blood I've lost.

00:19:31.730 --> 00:19:33.190
Margot...

00:19:40.240 --> 00:19:41.950
Tachibana Gin...?!

00:19:41.950 --> 00:19:43.080
Tes.

00:19:43.080 --> 00:19:45.290
Perhaps it is because I serve in office,

00:19:45.290 --> 00:19:47.460
but first I get drawn into this strange dimension,

00:19:47.460 --> 00:19:52.300
and now I find myself intervening in a fight between a Technohexen and a werewolf.

00:19:53.630 --> 00:19:56.340
Tres España has retained the right to wage war with Musashi

00:19:56.340 --> 00:19:58.760
ever since the Mikawa incident.

00:19:58.760 --> 00:20:02.100
I have not heard of England obtaining that right as well.

00:20:02.100 --> 00:20:04.310
This is entertainment for the festival.

00:20:04.310 --> 00:20:07.940
You're trying to stay on amicable terms with both Musashi and the Testament Union.

00:20:07.940 --> 00:20:11.150
If you fail, you will use the ludicrous fallacy that it was all "entertainment".

00:20:11.150 --> 00:20:13.480
I doubt such an excuse will work.

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:15.190
What are you going to do about it?

00:20:15.190 --> 00:20:17.740
I shall put England's justice on the right path.

00:20:17.740 --> 00:20:19.490
W-Wait!

00:20:19.490 --> 00:20:22.620
Don't rule me out of the match yet!

00:20:23.370 --> 00:20:25.120
You were weak.

00:20:25.950 --> 00:20:27.870
Please go to sleep.

00:20:28.830 --> 00:20:31.960
I will face you, Sir Drake.

00:20:31.960 --> 00:20:34.500
Even though my Brachium Justitia Vetus

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:38.590
makes any who dare defile England's justice fail without exception?

00:20:39.380 --> 00:20:40.260
Regardless,

00:20:40.260 --> 00:20:43.470
I shall show you that justice, failure and battle foresight

00:20:43.470 --> 00:20:48.940
mean nothing to the wife of the strongest man in the west, Tachibana Muneshige.

00:20:50.150 --> 00:20:51.690
Thinking time!

00:20:53.860 --> 00:20:55.690
The stance for a gravity sword...

00:20:55.690 --> 00:20:57.320
This will be tricky.

00:20:58.360 --> 00:21:00.490
Bind, Slicing Dragonfly!

00:21:34.360 --> 00:21:36.940
Yokomichi Masamitsu...

00:21:39.950 --> 00:21:42.990
Ah, Suzu, th-that's the spot!

00:21:42.990 --> 00:21:44.620
Use your pointer finger to...

00:21:44.620 --> 00:21:46.740
Y-You made me squeal...

00:21:46.740 --> 00:21:47.490
You're amazing.

00:21:47.950 --> 00:21:49.450
L-Like this?

00:21:49.450 --> 00:21:52.330
This is my first time. Is that okay?

00:21:52.330 --> 00:21:54.330
Th-That's it!

00:21:54.330 --> 00:21:56.250
I-I can't take it any longer...

00:21:56.250 --> 00:21:59.510
Captain, there is loud music and...

00:21:59.510 --> 00:22:02.930
and the ladies are breathing heavily!

00:22:02.930 --> 00:22:04.890
S-Say what?!

00:22:04.890 --> 00:22:07.430
Dame Dudley is currently on her way here!

00:22:07.430 --> 00:22:09.060
Hurry it up!

00:22:09.060 --> 00:22:11.140
Don't blame me if we're too late.

00:22:11.770 --> 00:22:15.610
In the end, Naito and Ulquiaga are the only ones to escape the barrier.

00:22:15.610 --> 00:22:18.440
The other three should still be fighting their duels.

00:22:18.980 --> 00:22:20.400
If even one of them loses,

00:22:20.820 --> 00:22:24.870
it will give our opponents the right to challenge Tori.

00:22:24.870 --> 00:22:26.990
My foolish brother is in a dire pinch, isn't he?

00:22:26.990 --> 00:22:28.830
We have no choice but to believe

00:22:29.410 --> 00:22:31.620
that everyone will protect those two!

00:22:34.960 --> 00:22:36.290
Let's go.

00:22:36.290 --> 00:22:38.590
Master Tenzo, there is something I wish to show you.

00:22:40.090 --> 00:22:42.090
This festival will probably be

00:22:42.420 --> 00:22:44.260
the last chance I get to show it to you.
